# Capacitor writes a fresh copy of config.xml on every `cap sync`, and macOS
# names each one "config 2.xml", "config 3.xml"… Three of them are already
# tracked; these are byte-identical to config.xml and pure noise, so every sync
# was leaving a dirty tree behind. The real file (config.xml) is not matched.
ios/App/App/config [0-9]*.xml
android/app/src/main/res/xml/config [0-9]*.xml
